WEBVTT

00:00.500 --> 00:07.466
Welcome to Gradelings for teachers. Let's set up your first class. It takes about a minute.

00:07.916 --> 00:15.043
On the Your classes page, type a class name, pick the grade, and choose your province or state.

00:15.043 --> 00:16.693
Then tap Create class.

00:17.143 --> 00:24.457
If you teach two neighbouring grades, choose a second grade, and your class can use units from both.

00:24.907 --> 00:33.113
Every class has a class code. Families can use it to link their own child, and you only ever see first names,

00:33.113 --> 00:37.028
grade and practice results for the units you assign.

00:37.478 --> 00:43.576
Along the top are five tabs: Progress, Homework, Live, Students and Settings.

00:43.576 --> 00:46.743
Progress is where you'll look every day.

00:47.193 --> 00:53.284
If you'd like a weekly summary, tick Email me every Monday. It lists who practised,

00:53.284 --> 00:56.806
how homework is going, and who to check in with.

00:57.256 --> 01:01.296
Next, add your students. That's the next video.
